CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'protocol == htons(ETH_P_FCOE)'
#199: FILE: drivers/net/ethernet/intel/ixgbe/ixgbe_main.c:7078:
+	if ((protocol == htons(ETH_P_FCOE)) &&
 	    (tx_ring->netdev->features & (NETIF_F_FSO | NETIF_F_FCOE_CRC))) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

